<title>HONG KONG: Chevalier (OA) interim net up 89 pct.</title>
<headline>Chevalier (OA) interim net up 89 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.49	   vs  4.14</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	    vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  12.59 profit vs  17.26 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    50.69	  vs  26.82</p>
<p>    Turnover		     627.82	 vs  544.70</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chevalier (OA) International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Chevalier (OA) International is a supplier of office automation and telecommunications systems.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$12.59 million on sale of properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
